SUMMARY:Grant Writing
DESCRIPTION:Youth Entrepreneurship Workshop \nSummer Company Program for Aspiring Youth Entrepreneurs! \nHave a business idea? \nLearn how to apply for funding through the summer company program. \nGuest speaker: Renee Xu (MSW/RSW) \nWhat you will learn:  \n\nSummer company program eligibility and funding opportunities\nApplication requirements and how to prepare\nHow to explore and develop a business idea\nStart-up budgeting and cash flow forecasting\nGrant-writing tips to strengthen your application\n\nTo Register: Please fill this form \nFor more information: Please contact \nOlena Yatsura at oyatsura@culturelink.ca or 437-225-0568 \nMarushka Fernandes at mfernandes@culturelink.ca \nWendy Yang at wendy@scaddingcourt.org or 647-564-5478 \n 
URL:https://www.culturelink.ca/event/grant-writing/
CATEGORIES:Youth
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.culturelink.ca/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Youth-Employment-CultureLink-Icon.jpg
LOCATION:
